# RefactorGPT Tools – Cursor rules

Project: Ruby CLI tools for refactoring (refactor_gpt.rb), code search (ag_gpt.rb), bash generation (bash_gpt.rb), Q&A (ask_gpt.rb), git commit (git_commit_gpt.rb), MR review (git_review_gpt.rb), merge conflict resolution (git_resolve_gpt.rb), superagent TUI (superagent.rb; subcommand ask = sandboxed one-shot Q&A, used for session continuation). Entry points use lib/loader (Zeitwerk autoloading; lib/superagent collapsed to top-level constants). Shared code in lib/ (agents_file_handler, ask_client_instructions, ask_gemini_client, ask_gpt_client, commit_path_corrections, commit_plan_client, completion_notifier, diff_compactor, diff_processor, gemini_client, git_commit_display, git_commit_rubocop, instance_lock, llm_router, mr_review_client, mr_review_display, openai_client, openrouter_client, prompt_reader, refactor_gpt_utils, signal_handler, system_info, utility); superagent in lib/superagent/ (agent_executor, agent_prompt_builder, assistant_text_accumulator, attempt_execution, auto_only_lock, config_path, display, json_stream_parser, long_build_detector, modified_files_tracker, outcome_display, pass_timing_builder, pass_timing_display, pending_request_queue, process_descendants, prompt_compactor, queue_display, refactor_needed_check, request_history_formatter, request_preparer, request_reader, run_failure_classifier, same_tool_error_tracker, session_id_registry, session_tracker, stream_line_parser, superagent, test_runner_detector, tool_call_formatter, tool_outcome, verification_display, verification_handler). Config: .env with MODEL, TECHNICAL_MODEL, IMAGE_MODEL, OPENROUTER_API_KEY; backend from model name with OpenRouter fallback. Tests in test/ (classification_parsing_test, diff_compactor_test, request_preparer_test, verification_parsing_test, tool_outcome_test, same_tool_error_tracker_test).
